  "title": "动作属性",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>动作属性</h1>\n  <table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Aras_Blue\" style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; left: 0px; top: 29px;\" width=\"963\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width: 16.789%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 17.228%;\">\n      <col style=\"width: 65.983%;\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"t1st\">\n        <td style=\"border: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\" style=\"color: #808080;\">属性名称</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\" style=\"color: #808080;\">是否必填</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-top: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_header\" style=\"color: #808080;\">说明</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Name</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">Y</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">动作的名称</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Label</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">Y</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">显示在动作菜单中的标签。这是一个多语言字符串。请参阅<a href=\"#\" class=\"internal-doc-link\">国际化</a>。</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Type</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">Y</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">决定动作在菜单中的显示位置</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Location</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">Y</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">指定动作的运行位置</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Method</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">Y</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">动作调用的已编写代码</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Target</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">Y</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">动作的运行目标</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">On Complete</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">N</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">动作完成后运行的方法</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"border-left: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Body</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">N</p>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"border-right: Solid 1px #c0c0c0; border-bottom: Solid 1px #c0c0c0;\">\n          <p class=\"Table_Body\">用于指定 AML 的区域</p>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n</div></body></html>",
